So far I have really enjoyed the simplicity of Structured!! I am doing a trial run for about a week to see if it will be a good fit for my everyday life and training my clients!! 
I really like how you can customize just a few things in the free version that make it feel more like &#34;your&#34; planner instead of just another app your &#39;trying.&#39; 
I am wanting to move away from writing things down and then losing them in the plethora of notes that i Have or losing my journal all together.

Best planner I have ever used. Some of my favorite features:
🔸Everything is customizable, and you can assign a color to any task; 
🔸Daily planner - enjoy the gratifying feeling of crossing off an item on your todo list; 
🔸Monthly planner - the monthly planner provides a condensed, organized, and visually appealing overview of daily tasks;
🔸Syncs to all devices
